#: ../../../interop/dbus-vmstate.rst:3
msgid "D-Bus VMState"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../interop/dbus-vmstate.rst:5
msgid ""
"The QEMU dbus-vmstate object's aim is to migrate helpers' data running on a "
"QEMU D-Bus bus. (refer to the :doc:`dbus` document for some recommendations "
"on D-Bus usage)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../interop/dbus-vmstate.rst:9
msgid ""
"Upon migration, QEMU will go through the queue of ``org.qemu.VMState1`` D-"
"Bus name owners and query their ``Id``. It must be unique among the helpers."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../interop/dbus-vmstate.rst:13
msgid ""
"It will then save arbitrary data of each Id to be transferred in the "
"migration stream and restored/loaded at the corresponding destination helper."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../interop/dbus-vmstate.rst:17
msgid ""
"For now, the data amount to be transferred is arbitrarily limited to 1Mb. "
"The state must be saved quickly (a fraction of a second). (D-Bus imposes a "
"time limit on reply anyway, and migration would fail if data isn't given "
"quickly enough.)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../interop/dbus-vmstate.rst:22
msgid ""
"dbus-vmstate object can be configured with the expected list of helpers by "
"setting its ``id-list`` property, with a comma-separated ``Id`` list."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../../backends/dbus-vmstate1.xml:1
msgid ""
"This interface must be implemented at the object path ``/org/qemu/VMState1`` "
"to support helper migration."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../../backends/dbus-vmstate1.xml:0
msgid "Arguments"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../../backends/dbus-vmstate1.xml:1
msgid "data to restore the state."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../../backends/dbus-vmstate1.xml:1
msgid "The method called on destination with the state to restore."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../../backends/dbus-vmstate1.xml:1
msgid ""
"The helper may be initially started in a waiting state (with an ``-"
"incoming`` argument for example), and it may resume on success."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../../backends/dbus-vmstate1.xml:1
msgid "An error may be returned to the caller."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../../backends/dbus-vmstate1.xml:0
msgid "Returns"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../../backends/dbus-vmstate1.xml:1
msgid "state data to save for later resume."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../../backends/dbus-vmstate1.xml:1
msgid ""
"The method called on the source to get the current state to be migrated. The "
"helper should continue to run normally."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../interop/dbus-vmstate.rst:0
msgid "Access"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../interop/dbus-vmstate.rst:0
msgid "Emits Changed"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../../backends/dbus-vmstate1.xml:1
msgid ""
"A string that identifies the helper uniquely. (maximum 256 bytes including "
"terminating NUL byte)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../../backends/dbus-vmstate1.xml:1
msgid ""
"The VMState helper ID namespace is its own namespace. In particular, it is "
"not related to QEMU \"id\" used in -object/-device objects."
msgstr ""
